WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Audio description: A round photo of Simone on a cream screen.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.800
Hey, I'm Simone, and I explain how things work.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:13.400
Audio description: A card titled Run summary, with three rows: Built the flow, Runs without errors, and Anyone knows why it works.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.200
Here is a run summary for your last flow.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.000
It was built, and it succeeded.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.800
It runs without errors, and that succeeded too.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.100
But does anyone know why it works?

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:26.000
That one is waiting on you.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.300
Audio description: A ghost floats up the right side, and three small bats fly across the top.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.600
Haunted by unexplained flows.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.000
Most flows get built.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.600
Fewer get explained.

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.200
FlowNarrate writes down the reasoning behind each step.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:42.500
Written by Simone Palmer-Thompson,

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.500
a CRM Specialist and a Microsoft Certified Trainer.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.200
Audio description: A round Microsoft Certified Trainer badge appears beside the job titles.

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:56.500
Audio description: Large pink letters: AB-100. A blue shield badge says Expert, with three stars.

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:02.900
Audio description: Below, three product names with small icons: Dynamics 365, Power Platform and Copilot Studio.

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.400
Certified in AB-100,

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.000
designing AI agent solutions for businesses,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:12.700
across Dynamics 365, Power Platform and Copilot Studio.

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:17.900
Audio description: The FlowNarrate logo in white, with a pink dot, and the web address flownarrate.com.

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.800
Read a narration, or try thirteen free tools,

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:23.200
at flownarrate dot com.
